Revision history for Data-Shared

0.01  2026-10-25
    - Initial release: one path API over the 39 Data-*-Shared dists, with
      string, array and compiled path tiers, manifest-backed roots, deep
      composite paths, node cursors and read-only opens.
    - Compiled dispatch resolves once and reuses the binding, so hot loops
      cost a fraction of a string-path call; see PERFORMANCE for measurements.
